%% Option F. Parts only: terms
%% The same parts as option E, but the core names no kinds of computation. Domain ontologies or a
%% vocabulary name them. Added for comparison.

    Computing["<b>computing process</b><br>PMD_0000583 computing process<br><br>Definition: A planned process in which one or more computing devices execute software to derive information content entities (the specified outputs) from information content entities (the specified inputs)."]:::changed
    Simulation["<b>simulation process</b><br>PMD_0000933 simulation process<br><br>Definition: A computing process that answers a computational task by solving one or more models, and post-processing the results where needed."]:::changed
    ModelSolution["<b>model solution process</b><br>PMD_0000583 computing process<br><br>Definition: A computing process that applies a solver to a model with given conditions and produces the model's raw results."]:::proposed
    PostProcessing["<b>post-processing</b><br>PMD_0000583 computing process<br><br>Definition: A computing process that derives results from raw results without changing the state of the modelled system."]:::proposed
    WorkflowRun["<b>workflow run</b><br>PMD_0000016 workflow run"]:::changed
    HighThroughput["<b>high throughput simulation</b><br>PMD_0000783 high throughput simulation<br><br>a workflow run with many simulations as parts"]:::changed
    SimSpec["<b>simulation specification</b><br>IAO_0000104 plan specification<br><br>Definition: A plan specification that describes a simulation: its computational task, the models and solvers to use, and how they are combined."]:::proposed
    Task["<b>computational task specification</b><br>IAO_0000005 objective specification<br><br>Definition: An objective specification that states what a computation is to determine: which quantities of a modelled system are to be computed, and under which conditions."]:::proposed
    PropertyTask["<b>property evaluation task</b><br>IAO_0000005 objective specification<br><br>to compute quantities of a modelled system at one given state"]:::proposed
    EquilibriumTask["<b>equilibrium task</b><br>IAO_0000005 objective specification<br><br>to find a state in which the modelled system is in equilibrium or steady state"]:::proposed
    TimeTask["<b>time evolution task</b><br>IAO_0000005 objective specification<br><br>to compute how the state of a modelled system changes over time"]:::proposed
    SamplingTask["<b>sampling task</b><br>IAO_0000005 objective specification<br><br>to compute averages or distributions over many states, drawn from an ensemble"]:::proposed
    ParameterTask["<b>parameter estimation task</b><br>IAO_0000005 objective specification<br><br>to find values of a model's parameters that agree with given data"]:::proposed
    OptimizationTask["<b>optimization task</b><br>IAO_0000005 objective specification<br><br>to find design variables that best meet an objective under constraints"]:::proposed
    Model["<b>mathematical model</b><br>IAO_0000030 information content entity<br><br>Definition: An information content entity that represents a system by relations between quantities, so that values of some quantities can be derived from others."]:::proposed
    PhysicsModel["<b>physics-based model</b><br>IAO_0000030 information content entity<br><br>Definition: A mathematical model made of one physics equation and one or more materials relations, together with the initial and boundary conditions needed to solve it."]:::proposed
    DataModel["<b>data-based model</b><br>IAO_0000030 information content entity<br><br>Definition: A mathematical model whose relation between inputs and outputs is obtained by fitting a general functional form to data."]:::proposed
    Equation["<b>physics equation</b><br>IAO_0000030 information content entity<br><br>Definition: An information content entity that states a general relation between physics quantities of one kind of entity, derived from fundamental physics and valid for all materials."]:::proposed
    ElectronicEq["<b>electronic physics equation</b><br>IAO_0000030 information content entity<br><br>about electrons"]:::proposed
    AtomisticEq["<b>atomistic physics equation</b><br>IAO_0000030 information content entity<br><br>about atoms"]:::proposed
    MesoscopicEq["<b>mesoscopic physics equation</b><br>IAO_0000030 information content entity<br><br>about grains or groups of atoms"]:::proposed
    ContinuumEq["<b>continuum physics equation</b><br>IAO_0000030 information content entity<br><br>about continuum volumes"]:::proposed
    MaterialsRelation["<b>materials relation</b><br>IAO_0000030 information content entity<br><br>Definition: An information content entity that supplies the values or functions for the parameters of a physics equation, valid for the class of materials for which it was made or tested."]:::proposed
    Potential["<b>interatomic potential</b><br>IAO_0000030 information content entity<br><br>Definition: A materials relation that gives the potential energy of a system of atoms as a function of their positions."]:::proposed
    Solver["<b>solver specification</b><br>PMD_0000931 simulation method specification<br><br>relabelled<br>Definition: A plan specification that describes the analytical or numerical technique used to solve a model."]:::changed
    AnalyticalMethod["<b>analytical solution method</b><br>PMD_0000931 simulation method specification<br><br>Definition: A solver specification that obtains the solution from closed-form expressions."]:::proposed
    NumericalMethod["<b>numerical method</b><br>PMD_0000931 simulation method specification<br><br>Definition: A solver specification that approximates the solution by discretization or iteration."]:::proposed
    MCMethod["<b>Monte Carlo method</b><br>PMD_0000931 simulation method specification<br><br>Definition: A numerical method that estimates results from random samples."]:::proposed
    Stochastic["<b>stochastic simulation</b><br>PMD_0000951 stochastic simulation"]:::local
    Physical["<b>physical simulation</b><br>PMD_0000884 physical simulation<br><br>a lab process (Gleeble), not a computation"]:::deprecated
    Device["<b>computing device</b><br>PMD_0000582 computing device<br><br>Definition: A device that executes software."]:::changed
